  <div id="root"><div class="min-h-screen w-full relative overflow-x-clip" style="background-color: rgb(246, 245, 242); padding-top: var(--safe-area-inset-top); box-sizing: border-box;"><div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 w-full h-[3px] bg-[#0A0A0A]"></div><div class="relative z-10 w-full"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[720px] px-[24px] py-[40px] md:px-[80px] md:py-[72px]"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="h-[32px] w-[32px] bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] font-medium text-[12px] leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] select-none" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">S2</div><div class="flex flex-col leading-none"><span class="text-[16px] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#0A0A0A] font-[600]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;">seen2wice</span><span class="mt-[2px] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Seen twice</span></div></div><div class="pt-[6px] text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">NYC • Miami • LA</div></div><div class="mt-[64px] md:mt-[84px]"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4"><div class="relative w-[200px] h-[200px] rounded-[2px] border bg-[#FBF9F6] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden" style="border-color: rgb(237, 233, 227);"><div class="px-[18px] text-center"><p class="text-[12px] leading-[1.5] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Professional headshot — shop background, suit, not home/family — replace this</p><div class="mt-3 h-[1px] w-full bg-[#EDE9E3]"></div><p class="mt-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">200 × 200 • JPG / PNG</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><button class="rounded-[2px] border border-[#0A0A0A] bg-white px-3 py-[7px] text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#0A0A0A] transition hover:bg-[#0A0A0A] hover:text-white" type="button" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Upload headshot</button><span class="text-[11px] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Local preview</span><input type="file" accept="image/*" class="hidden"></div></div><h1 class="mt-10 text-[42px] md:text-[48px] font-[600] leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#0A0A0A]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;">Corey T. Gooden</h1><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><span class="text-[22px] md:text-[24px] italic leading-none text-[#4A4A4A]" style="font-family: Fraunces, serif; font-weight: 400;">Entrepreneur</span><span class="text-[#8A8885] text-[18px] leading-none">—</span><span class="text-[22px] md:text-[24px] leading-none text-[#0A0A0A]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;">Founder, seen2wice.com</span></div><p class="mt-6 max-w-[480px] text-[18px] leading-[1.6] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">We make local shops seen twice — on Google and Instagram.</p><div class="mt-10 h-[1px] w-full bg-[#EDE9E3]"></div></div><section class="mt-14"><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">About</div><div class="mt-5 space-y-5 max-w-[600px]"><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">I founded seen2wice to solve one problem: middle-scale shops in NYC, Miami, LA do great work but don't show up when clients Google 'best barbershop near me' or check Instagram. They lose 3-5 clients daily to competitors who look active.</p><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">We film in your shop, edit, post, and make you rank — you keep cutting, we make you seen. 47 shops, done-for-you, $800-$5000 packages, month-to-month.</p></div></section><section class="mt-14"><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Seen2wice</div><div class="mt-5 max-w-[600px] space-y-3"><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;"><span class="text-[#8A8885] mr-2">—</span>We make you LOOK expensive (Instagram, TikTok, Google redesign — UES billionaire level)</p><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;"><span class="text-[#8A8885] mr-2">—</span>12-50 videos filmed in your shop + posted across Instagram, TikTok, Google, Facebook</p><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;"><span class="text-[#8A8885] mr-2">—</span>RANK #1 for near me — Upper East Side billionaires, Soho models, Tribeca families find YOU</p></div></section><section class="mt-14"><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Packages</div><div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3"><div class="rounded-[2px] border bg-white p-[20px]" style="border-color: rgb(237, 233, 227);"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Starter</span><span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.06em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">12 videos • shop-only</span></div><div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-[22px] font-[600] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#0A0A0A]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;">$800</span><span class="text-[11px] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">/month</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Instagram refresh + Google Business profile fix + 12 reels filmed in-shop. Look active, stop losing walk-ins.</p></div><div class="rounded-[2px] bg-[#FBF9F6] p-[20px] relative" style="border-width: 1.5px 1.5px 1.5px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(10, 10, 10); border-image: none;"><div class="absolute top-[-1px] right-[20px] bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white px-2 py-[3px] rounded-b-[2px] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Most booked</div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#0A0A0A] font-medium" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Growth</span><span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.06em] text-[#4A4A4A]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">30 videos • multi-platform</span></div><div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-[22px] font-[600] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#0A0A0A]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;">$2000</span><span class="text-[11px] text-[#4A4A4A]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">/month</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">30 videos filmed in your shop, edited, posted to IG / TikTok / Google / FB. Rank for 'near me', feed looks expensive. For shops ready to dominate block.</p></div><div class="rounded-[2px] border bg-white p-[20px]" style="border-color: rgb(237, 233, 227);"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Dominance</span><span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.06em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">50 videos • rank #1</span></div><div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-[22px] font-[600] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#0A0A0A]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;">$4000</span><span class="text-[11px] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">/month</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">Full take-over: 50 videos, daily stories, UES-level redesign, Google posts, review engine. You own 'best barbershop near me' in your zip.</p></div><div class="rounded-[2px] border bg-white p-[20px]" style="border-color: rgb(237, 233, 227);"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Empire</span><span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.06em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Multi-shop • NYC/MIA/LA</span></div><div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-[22px] font-[600] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#0A0A0A]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;">$5000</span><span class="text-[11px] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">/month</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">For owners with 2-4 shops. Same quality in every location, centralized posting, competitor domination across boroughs.</p></div></div><p class="mt-4 text-[11px] leading-[1.6] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Month-to-month • No personal data collected • Business shoots only • Cancel anytime</p></section><section class="mt-14"><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Contact</div><div class="mt-6 rounded-[2px] border bg-white px-[20px] py-[22px]" style="border-color: rgb(237, 233, 227);"><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Email</span><a href="mailto:hello@seen2wice.com" class="text-[15px] text-[#0A0A0A] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-[#EDE9E3] hover:decoration-[#0A0A0A] transition" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">hello@seen2wice.com</a></div><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Business line</span><span class="text-[15px] text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">+1 (938) 306-7962</span></div><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">WhatsApp</span><a href="https://wa.me/19383067962" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[15px] text-[#0A0A0A] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-[#0A0A0A]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">wa.me/19383067962 — business inquiries only</a></div><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Website</span><a href="https://seen2wice.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[15px] text-[#0A0A0A] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-[#EDE9E3] hover:decoration-[#0A0A0A] transition" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">seen2wice.com</a></div><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">LinkedIn</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/coreytgooden" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[15px] text-[#0A0A0A] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-[#EDE9E3] hover:decoration-[#0A0A0A] transition" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">linkedin.com/in/coreytgooden</a></div></div><div class="mt-6 h-[1px] w-full bg-[#EDE9E3]"></div><p class="mt-4 text-[11px] leading-[1.6] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Business contact only. No home address, no personal email, no DMs. Response time: same business day 9am-6pm EST.</p></div></section><div class="mt-14 rounded-[2px] border border-dashed bg-[#FBF9F6] px-[20px] py-[18px]" style="border-color: rgb(214, 210, 204);"><div class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-[2px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#0A0A0A]"></span><div><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#0A0A0A]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">Privacy • Owner note</div><p class="mt-2 text-[12px] leading-[1.7] text-[#4A4A4A]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">This site uses business contact only. No home address, no personal email, no birthday, no family photos. WHOIS privacy enabled. For business inquiries only: hello@seen2wice.com — This box is public to signal privacy stance, not indexed as personal data.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-3"><div class="h-[1px] flex-1 bg-[#EDE9E3]"></div><span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8A8885]" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">End of business profile</span><div class="h-[1px] flex-1 bg-[#EDE9E3]"></div></div></div></div><footer class="relative z-10 mt-2 w-full bg-[#0A0A0A] px-[24px] py-[32px] md:px-[48px]"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[720px] flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="h-[28px] w-[28px] bg-white text-[#0A0A0A] flex items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] text-[11px] font-medium" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace;">S2</div><div class="flex flex-col leading-none"><span class="text-[15px] text-white tracking-[-0.02em]" style="font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, serif;">seen2wice